+### Digit-leading *pattern variable* (2026-10-12)
+
+**Repro:** a clause `| byRight 1=0 => …`, with `1=0` meant as the name of a proof of `1 = 0`.
+
+**Error:** not a parser error but `'Nat.suc' is not a constructor of data type Path` — the pattern `1=0` lexes as the numeral `1` followed by more tokens, so the clause matches the path against `suc zero`.
+
+**Fix:** start the name with a letter (`one=zero`).
+
